Subject: [PATCH] [M156] [highlights] Build highlight layers from paint markers

Original change's description:
> [highlights] Build highlight layers from paint markers
>
> Editing can move custom highlight markers to a new text node before the
> per-node registry is rebuilt. Synchronous SVG resource painting can then
> dereference a missing registry entry.
>
> Collect the active highlight names from the markers being painted
> instead, keeping paint layers consistent with their edges. Retain the
> per-node cache for hit testing and remove its unsafe paint accessor.
>
> Add a regression test that splits highlighted text and computes layers
> and edges before validation, covering both the new prefix and the
> original suffix as well as duplicate highlight names.
>
